      "observation": "Fourth centered grip brings a shallow rice remnant to the open mouth. Bite758 removes another portion; hands then move down together while the mouth chews. The small remnant is difficult to distinguish from the pale belly in the front hold, but remains visible over the dark hands in oblique view."
