      "observation": "Fifth approach rotates the mostly seaweed-covered remnant upright. Contact911 and bite920 leave a narrow dark strip with a pale rice edge, held continuously between the paws. It can resemble a thin stalk at thumbnail scale; front and oblique views still show it following the grip. Withdrawal begins after mouth closure."
